### Testing Best Practices

- Run tests: `pnpm test` or `pnpm test:watch`
- Test files: `*.spec.ts` or `*.test.ts` colocated with source
- Use `screen.getByRole` queries over `getByTestId`
- Mock API calls at the service layer
- Setup file: `test/setup.ts`

