### Quality Commands

```bash
pnpm lint        # Check linting
pnpm lint:fix    # Fix lint issues
pnpm format      # Format code
pnpm ts-check    # Type check
pnpm test        # Run tests
pnpm validate    # Full validation (build + test + lint + format)
```
